# Unity project .gitignore — VGDD template.
# The Technical Director copies this to the game project's root at scaffold time
# (works for game-at-root or GameProject/ layouts — patterns are relative).
# IMPORTANT: .meta files are TRACKED, never ignored (import settings live there).

# === Unity generated / caches (regenerated on open) ===
[Ll]ibrary/
[Tt]emp/
[Oo]bj/
[Ll]ogs/
[Uu]serSettings/
[Mm]emoryCaptures/
*.log
sysinfo.txt
/[Aa]ssets/_Recovery
/[Aa]ssets/_Recovery.meta

# === Build outputs ===
[Bb]uilds/
[Bb]uild/
*.unitypackage
*.app
*.apk
*.aab
*.xcworkspace/
*.xcodeproj/

# === Studio run artifacts (all batch test/build logs + result XMLs go here) ===
/VGDDLogs/

# === CI / test-run temporaries (GameCI etc.) ===
/[Aa]rtifacts/
/[Cc]odeCoverage/
# belt-and-braces for stragglers written outside VGDDLogs/
/*results*.xml
/TestResults*.xml
/*.log

# === IDE-generated (regenerated by the editor) ===
.idea/
.vs/
.vsconfig
*.csproj
*.sln
*.slnx
*.suo
*.tmp
*.user
*.userprefs
*.pidb
*.booproj
*.svd
*.pdb
*.mdb

# === Asset store tools ===
[Aa]ssets/AssetStoreTools*

# === Agent/harness local settings (never commit) ===
.claude/settings.local.json

# === OS / editor cruft ===
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
*~
